Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.00,0:00:29.00,Default,,0000,0000,0008,,{\blur3}《福尔摩斯历险记》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.50,0:01:23.30,Default,,0000,0000,0008,,{\blur3}《硬纸盒案》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.64,0:01:43.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我并非说制服不适合你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now I won't say as how the uniform don't suit you,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.10,0:01:47.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}库欣小姐 但很高兴看到你没有穿着它来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Miss Cushing. But it is nice to see you out of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.98,0:01:52.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}莎拉 莎拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sarah, Sarah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.99,0:02:02.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您肯定是另一位库欣小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must be the other Miss Cushing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.74,0:02:06.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}今天非常开心吧 对于你们三姐妹来说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Isn't this a happy day then, eh, for all three of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.08,0:02:09.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 是的 当然是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, yes it is, of course it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.53,0:02:41.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.74,0:03:26.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}盗墓贼在伦敦北部大肆作案\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Body Snatchers Strike in North London."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.95,0:03:30.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们在处理一桩现代版的伯克和黑尔案吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Are we dealing with a modern version of Burke and Hare?"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.75,0:03:33.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不幸的是 在这个时节里解剖学院并不需要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, sadly, the anatomy schools don't need the help{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.96,0:03:36.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}盗墓贼的帮助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of body snatchers at this time of the year.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.25,0:03:38.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们存了很多从救济院运来的尸体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They are well stocked with corpses from the poor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.67,0:03:40.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那你怎么看呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you think then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.67,0:03:44.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不知道 也许是某种古怪的祭礼吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know. Some outlandish cult, perhaps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.35,0:03:48.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们就此事咨询过你了吗 福尔摩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you been consulted on the subject Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.43,0:03:50.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}进来 霍金斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come in, Hawkins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.10,0:03:52.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}啊哈 霍金斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah Hawkins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.94,0:03:55.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请自便 来点咖啡吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make yourself at home. Have a cup of coffee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.15,0:03:57.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.82,0:03:59.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你把记录带来了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you brought those descriptions?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.28,0:04:01.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 带来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, yes I have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.82,0:04:07.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现已被挖走的尸体有 艾伯特 考特 48岁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bodies so far exhumed, "Albert Cotter, forty eight."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.33,0:04:10.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}沙德韦尔的守鱼人 死于心脏病\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Fish porter of Shadwell. Heart disease."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.25,0:04:13.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}马丁 鲁伯里 44岁 死于肝硬化\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Martin Rubery, fifty four. Cirrhosis of the liver."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.50,0:04:15.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对他不甚了解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't know much about him, except it was thought{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.33,0:04:18.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只知道他年轻时曾是一名业余拳击手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he was an amateur pugilist of some sort in his youth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.84,0:04:22.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}杰米 金 39岁 女修道院花园看守人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Jimmy King, thirty nine. Covent Garden Porter."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.47,0:04:23.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}死于脑出血\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Cerebral hemorrhage."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.26,0:04:27.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你会继续追查吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will continue your researches?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.35,0:04:28.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果您希望这样 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you say so, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.72,0:04:29.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我希望这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do say so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.64,0:04:34.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}并且盯住一位默多克 格尔的住所\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And keep your eye on the premises of a certain Murdoch Gull.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.73,0:04:38.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}什么？你认为是默多克？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes? Murdoch, you think?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.65,0:04:42.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他是一切离经叛道的维护者 他可能是我们要找的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is the fence for anything out of the ordinary? It could be a man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.15,0:04:46.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有一件事 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One more thing, Mr. Holmes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.78,0:04:48.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们将万分荣幸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The men and I would be very honoured{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.53,0:04:51.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果圣诞节您愿意来访\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if you'd drop by Christmas Eve.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.54,0:04:54.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们将在圣诞节举办一个晚会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We try to get a bit festive at Christmas, and{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.12,0:04:56.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}邀请一些客人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we like to invite a few guests.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.29,0:04:59.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}圣诞节\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Christmas...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.44,0:05:21.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}玛丽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mary?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.74,0:05:27.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}玛丽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mary?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.41,0:05:35.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好了 这才刚开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There. It's a start.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.96,0:05:37.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哈德森太太\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mrs. Hudson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.21,0:05:38.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.54,0:05:41.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我该再送华生什么礼物好呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How am I supposed to think up yet another present for Watson?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.38,0:05:44.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}每年这时你都让我头痛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, every year you inflict this agony on me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.13,0:05:46.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很简单 福尔摩斯先生 去家美家吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's quite simple, Mr. Holmes. You go to Gamages.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.01,0:05:47.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}家美家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gamages?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.68,0:05:50.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 在霍尔 是家百货商店\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. It's in Holborn, a department store.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.64,0:05:55.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}百姓商场 你会眼花缭乱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The people's Emporium. You will be quite spoilt for ideas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.36,0:06:05.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哈德森太太 你怎么敢拿走我的一叶兰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mrs. Hudson, how dare you take my aspidistra?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.74,0:06:08.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我就是敢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do dare.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.57,0:06:45.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}下午好 库欣小姐 节日愉快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Afternoon, Miss Cushing. Season's Greetings, eh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.07,0:06:47.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}下午好 威尔金森\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good afternoon, Wilkinson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.44,0:06:49.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}看起来马上又要下雪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks like we're in for a bit more snow before long.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.45,0:06:50.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我真希望别下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do hope not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.57,0:07:28.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是怎么回事 贾科泰先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is this Monsieur Jacotett?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.65,0:07:30.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}啊 苏珊女士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah, Madame Suzan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.32,0:07:31.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们已经说好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our arrangement is{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.66,0:07:34.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你可以在晚饭后坐在客厅火炉旁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that you may sit by the parlour fire after dinner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.16,0:07:36.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}否则 我将非常感激\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Otherwise, I would be obliged,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.62,0:07:41.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果您在这房子里时 只呆在自己房间里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when you are in the house, if you would keep to your room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.29,0:07:43.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你妹妹莎拉 是她允许我的 女士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your sister, Sarah, gave me permission, Madame.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.84,0:07:47.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是我家 不是我妹妹的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is my house, not my sister's.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.17,0:07:50.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就算她这么说了 当然我很怀疑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even if she said it, which I doubt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.51,0:07:53.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果我妹妹允许\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I would be most surprised if my sister gave{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.30,0:07:55.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的房客使用厨房\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the run of the kitchen to my lodger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.31,0:07:58.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你会惊讶令妹给了我什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You would be surprised what your sister gives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.43,0:08:01.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}非常惊讶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very surprised.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.94,0:08:05.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果您现在能离开厨房 我将十分感激 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think I would be obliged if you left the kitchen now, Monsieur.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.52,0:08:07.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我觉得您没听到我在说什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think you hear what I am saying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.19,0:08:08.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}苏珊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Susan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.03,0:08:13.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}马塞尔...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marcel...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.03,0:08:17.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 苏珊 成功了 他们让我当旅店的看守人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh Susan, it has worked. They have made me warden at the mission.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.41,0:08:19.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在你问问她 她给了我什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now you ask her what she gave me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.87,0:08:21.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是你给了贾科泰先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you give Monsieur Jacotett{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.75,0:08:24.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}随意使用厨房的准许吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}permission to help himself in here, in the kitchen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.54,0:08:30.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我给过一次 我没想到他会...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I believe I did, once. I didn't realize he'd...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.51,0:08:31.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}问她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ask her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.55,0:08:33.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你是什么意思 到底怎么回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you mean? What is going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.63,0:08:34.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}问她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ask her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.01,0:08:37.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你们英国人真是伪善\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You English are such hypocrites.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.70,0:08:40.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你现在告诉她你给了我什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now you tell her what you gave me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.14,0:08:41.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.06,0:08:42.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是怎么回事？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is all this about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.17,0:08:44.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谁能告诉我到底怎么...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will someone please tell me what's going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.24,0:08:58.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我懂了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.33,0:09:03.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我懂了 很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see. Very well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.12,0:09:09.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你现在是看守人了 到那儿住去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are warden now. Go and live there then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.75,0:09:12.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你在旅店会有住处的 去那儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll have quarters at the mission. Go there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.55,0:09:16.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不想你留在我家 走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want you under my roof. Go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.51,0:09:20.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不会让你住在这儿 不会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I won't have you here, I won't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.76,0:09:24.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而你 先生 你立刻离开我家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And as for you Monsieur, you will leave my house immediately.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.44,0:09:28.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}立刻 不然我就叫警察\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Immediately. Or I will call the police.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.07,0:09:34.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你的行李将被打包后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your belongings will be packed and{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.65,0:09:37.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}留在旁门那\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}left at the tradesmen's entrance for your collection.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.95,0:09:39.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你怎么敢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How dare you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.78,0:09:42.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你简直和妈妈一模一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You sound exactly like mother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.62,0:09:43.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那又如何\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if I do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.62,0:09:46.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我还以为她过世后 自己再也不会 听到那样的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought I'd heard the last of that sort of thing when she died.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.16,0:09:47.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你怎敢如此说妈妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How dare you talk about mother like that!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.08,0:09:50.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我像她有什么不好吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just as well I am like her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.34,0:09:52.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不然我不知道我们家会发生什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know what would happen to this family otherwise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.46,0:09:55.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你把我们都绑在你身边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh you hold us all together do you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.72,0:09:58.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你真伟大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How splendid you are!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.93,0:10:04.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你发现玛丽不声不响 就离开了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you realize that Mary has gone away without telling anyone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.23,0:10:08.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好极了 她最终还是表现出了点勇气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good. She's showing some spirit at last.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.81,0:10:10.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你说这好极了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You call that good?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.90,0:10:14.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有时候我觉得你不仅一事无成\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sometimes you're not just feckless,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.61,0:10:17.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而且故意推卸责任\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think you're deliberately irresponsible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.49,0:10:19.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}玛丽已经结婚了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mary is a married woman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.16,0:10:24.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不是你的功劳 你到最后都反对他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, no thanks to you. You stood in her way to the last.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.54,0:10:29.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}吉姆 布劳纳永远也不够资格 成为我们家一员 是吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jim Browner was never good enough for our family, was he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.83,0:10:33.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}库欣少校的女儿们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The daughters of Major Cushing RE?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.38,0:10:36.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}无所谓 他是个赌棍 我们的父亲则是...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never mind, he was a gambling wastrel. Our father was...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.01,0:10:40.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}住口 如果有谁让我们家蒙羞...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be quiet. If anyone has disgraced this family...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.51,0:10:41.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那就是我？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.26,0:10:46.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我警告你 总有一天这些责任\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I warn you, one day this diet of respectability{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.52,0:10:48.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}会让你自食其果\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is going to make you ill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.69,0:10:56.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你糟透了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are so... horrid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.24,0:11:05.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}亲爱的哈德森太太\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah dear Mrs. Hudson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.20,0:11:07.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生 有个人和医生一起来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Holmes, the doctor has someone with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.08,0:11:09.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}苏珊 库欣小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A Miss Susan Cushing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.58,0:11:10.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}知道了 请您拿好这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh well. You'd better hold onto this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.04,0:11:12.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.93,0:11:25.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.35,0:11:27.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是棵圣诞树\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah, that is a Christmas tree,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.49,0:11:30.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一棵挪威云杉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's a Norway spruce.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.23,0:11:33.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这位是库欣小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Miss Cushing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.36,0:11:39.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}库欣小姐很担心她的妹妹布劳纳太太\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Miss Cushing is concerned about her sister, Mrs. Browner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.11,0:11:41.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请继续\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pray continue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.86,0:11:44.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}库欣小姐最小的妹妹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Miss Cushing's youngest sister,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.62,0:11:48.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}和她住得并不远 就在东坎伯威尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}lives not far from her, just east of Camberwell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.79,0:11:52.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}布劳纳太太每周五都来她家喝茶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mrs. Browner visits her every Friday for tea,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.00,0:11:56.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}除非她通知了不来 而这也很少发生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}unless she sends excuses, which is most unusual.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.63,0:12:00.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}上个星期五 19号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Last Friday, the nineteenth,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.17,0:12:03.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}布劳纳太太既未送来消息亦未到来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mrs. Browner failed to send excuses or to arrive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.39,0:12:06.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}于是库欣小姐询问了她的房客\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, Miss Cushing has made inquiries at her lodgings,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.64,0:12:09.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是布劳纳太太打上个礼拜四起 就不曾露面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but Mrs. Browner has not been seen there since last Thursday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.02,0:12:12.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}听起来像是她失踪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sounds to me as if she has disappeared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.44,0:12:14.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很显然 福尔摩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Evidently, Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.31,0:12:16.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她的失踪可能有一两个原因\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There could be one or two reasons for her disappearance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.61,0:12:22.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要不就是有别的什么人希望她失踪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or because somebody else wished her to disappear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.36,0:12:26.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你知道有什么原因 可能使别人想让她消失吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know of any reason why anyone should want her to disappear?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.49,0:12:28.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}玛丽？没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mary? None.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.62,0:12:32.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她是最可爱的人 人人都喜欢她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's the most loveable of creatures. Everyone loves her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.00,0:12:35.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}至于她的下落\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As to her whereabouts,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.58,0:12:39.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我建议 您试试失踪人口处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, I suggest that you try the missing people agency.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.63,0:12:41.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我给您一张地址清单\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could find you a list of addresses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.88,0:12:43.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好了 哈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There, hah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.68,0:12:46.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}真迷人 不是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Charming, isn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.60,0:12:51.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对那棵云杉的小小改进\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Slight improvement on that rather sad pices excelsa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.32,0:13:05.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}莎拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sarah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.41,0:13:07.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}莎拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sarah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.32,0:13:08.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}马塞尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marcel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.46,0:13:16.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我等不了了 你让我疯狂 莎拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The waiting possessed me. You drive me mad Sarah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.96,0:13:19.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有时候我觉得我被附身了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sometimes I think I'm possessed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.29,0:13:20.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你现在住哪？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are you now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.75,0:13:23.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}医院附近的一个狗窝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some filthy hole near the hospital.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.26,0:13:26.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}都因为你姐姐 我不会让她忘记此事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks to your sister. I will not let her forget this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.72,0:13:34.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}圣诞节你要去比利时吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you going to Belgium still for Christmas?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.52,0:13:36.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 我叔叔住在奥斯坦德附近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. My uncle in Ostend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.10,0:13:40.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你回来后 我会为你写一封介绍信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, when you come back, I'll write a reference for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.82,0:13:43.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我现在是此处的看守 它能算数\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm Warden of this place. It'll count.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.24,0:13:46.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我爱你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.49,0:13:52.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}圣诞节以后来找我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come to me after Christmas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.45,0:14:34.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是邮件 库欣小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The post, Miss Cushing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.16,0:14:38.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我把包裹放在树下好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shall I put the parcels under the tree?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.25,0:14:39.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.84,0:14:49.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还是没有布劳纳太太的消息？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing from Mrs. Browner, yet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.63,0:14:51.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还是没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing as yet, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.68,0:14:55.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}撒津店今天送的东西里有马迪拉酒吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did Sudgen's include the Madeira in their delivery today?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.10,0:14:59.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 库欣小姐 今晚的一切都准备好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, Miss Cushing. Everything's ready for this evening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.06,0:15:01.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.61,0:15:12.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}节日快乐 布拉德布鲁克先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Compliments of the season, Mr. Bradbrook.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.78,0:15:14.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}非常感谢 您也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you very much, and the very same to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.55,0:15:30.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}库欣小姐 我说库欣小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Miss Cushing. I say Miss Cushing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.60,0:15:32.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.00,0:15:34.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}布拉德布鲁克先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Bradbrook.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.18,0:15:37.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}敢问您的妹妹 莎拉会来是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I dare say your sister, Sarah, will be joining us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.18,0:15:39.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很遗憾她不来 布拉德布鲁克先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm afraid not, Mr. Bradbrook.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.64,0:15:42.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她现在是米申旅店的看守人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's Warden now of the Mission Hostel now{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.44,0:15:44.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她有责任为了旅客留在那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}her duties to her residents will keep her there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.10,0:15:48.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}恐怕我只能 在周日见到她了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I shall see her only on Sundays now I fear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.70,0:15:54.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很遗憾让您失望了 布拉德布鲁克先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry to disappoint you, Mr. Bradbrook.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.28,0:15:56.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 不不不 您没有 一点也没\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no you haven't, not at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.29,0:16:00.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}来吧 布拉德布鲁克先生 今天是平安夜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come now, Mr. Bradbrook. It is Christmas Eve.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.96,0:16:03.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为了补偿您 我们晚饭一结束就来拆圣诞树下的礼物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To make up, we shall open our presents from the tree{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.96,0:16:06.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而不必等到午夜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}straight after supper instead of at midnight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.50,0:16:07.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您说呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.84,0:16:11.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很好 很好 太棒了 就这么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very well. Yes. Yes, fine. Splendid. Let's do that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.59,0:16:13.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}格拉德斯通最后会很开心的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, Gladstone will be pleased at least.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.01,0:16:16.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}其中有一份是给它的礼物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is a treat somewhere for him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.74,0:16:36.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}欢迎 先生们 真高兴你们能来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome gentlemen, very good of you to come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.78,0:16:38.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}格尔 逮着他了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gull? Has he been arrested?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.20,0:16:39.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.00,0:16:40.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他是来投诉的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's come to complain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.00,0:16:41.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Has he indeed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.16,0:16:43.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他发现了我们在监视他 他不喜欢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He has spotted our surveillance of him. He doesn't like it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.80,0:16:45.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你不会放弃？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You won't give up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.33,0:16:46.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当然不会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dear me, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.05,0:16:50.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好好玩吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Join the party.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.13,0:17:33.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.63,0:17:35.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请进\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. Come in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.34,0:17:40.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 我亲爱的朋友 你穿上它了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my dear fellow, you are wearing it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.26,0:17:44.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我得试试 它最大的好处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I had to try it. What's so good about it is...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.43,0:17:47.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就是可以在车笼头前铺开 如果你需要的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it stretches forward over the handlebars if you need it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.00,0:17:49.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你到底在哪儿发现的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where on earth did you find it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.98,0:17:52.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}家美家 百姓商场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gamages, the people's Emporium.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.57,0:17:55.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢 太棒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you. Pipe. Magnificent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.78,0:18:00.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}霍金斯 请进来吧 亲爱的朋友 请坐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hawkins, do come in, dear fellow. Please, sit down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.62,0:18:03.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}盗墓贼又有什么新消息？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is the news of the grave robberies?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.95,0:18:06.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}坎伯威尔分局来了消息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Camberwell force have been on to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.66,0:18:10.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那儿发生了一件意外 他们怀疑两件事是否有关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An incident down there. They were wondering if it had any connection.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.54,0:18:14.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我个人并不认为有 但我需要您的意见 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think it does myself, but I'd value your opinion Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.13,0:18:19.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们需要把这个下流的小玩笑 解决了处理掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need to get this nasty little joke solved and out of the way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.50,0:18:20.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}玩笑？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Joke?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.97,0:18:25.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一位尊敬的女士 在平安夜和朋友们一起 拆开她的包裹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Respectable lady, in company opening her parcels, Christmas Eve.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.56,0:18:29.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}其中一件有点奇怪 装满了盐 她把盐倒光\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One of them's bit odd, full of salt. She empties out the salt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.15,0:18:30.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}里面是什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's in it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.20,0:18:33.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}两只刚切下来的人耳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two freshly severed human ears.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.50,0:18:35.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们认为是个医学院学生干的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We think it was a medical student.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.50,0:18:37.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她曾有个房客是医学院学生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She had a medical student as a lodger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.50,0:18:39.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}解剖系学生可以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Post-mortem anatomy can make{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.80,0:18:42.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}轻而易举的做到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}certain individuals thoroughly callous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.33,0:18:45.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她在圣诞节前把他赶出来 显然有些争吵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She threw him out just before Christmas. Bit of a row. Apparently.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.33,0:18:47.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}无论如何 因为我知道您的办案方法 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anyway, knowing your methods, Mr. Holmes,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.50,0:18:51.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我把耳朵原封不动 留在那位女士的家里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've had the ears left quite untouched at the lady's house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.96,0:18:52.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which is,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.46,0:18:57.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}特拉法尔加别墅 坎波维尔 一位苏珊 库欣小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}yes. Here it is. Trafalgar Villa, Camberwell, A Miss Susan Cushing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.39,0:19:05.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生 您终于来帮我找玛丽了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Mr. Holmes, have you come to help me find Mary after all?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.64,0:19:07.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我很抱歉 库欣小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm afraid not, Miss Cushing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.18,0:19:12.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}警督请我来 查另一单不幸的案件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Inspector has asked me to look into that other, unfortunate business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.31,0:19:17.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 那个 霍金斯先生 我不会把东西放在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, that. Well, I won't have those things in the house, Mr. Hawkins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.30,0:19:19.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果您想看看的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you wish to see them,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.80,0:19:21.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您得去温室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you must go to the conservatory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.82,0:19:25.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那个不幸的年轻人被逮住了没\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you arrested that wretched young man yet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.24,0:19:27.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只是时间问题 库欣小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just a matter of time, Miss Cushing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.08,0:19:31.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哈里奇的邮戳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Postmarked Harwich.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.53,0:19:33.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}贾科泰这个学生现在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now this student fellow Jacotett{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.71,0:19:35.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在回家过圣诞节\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}was going home for Christmas{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.20,0:19:37.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}从哈里奇去往奥斯坦德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to Ostend via Harwich.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.09,0:19:39.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 我同意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, I agree,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.13,0:19:43.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哈里奇能说明这点 字迹很差\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Harwich is persuasive. The writing is poor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.84,0:19:45.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}未受过教育\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uneducated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.68,0:19:50.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我知道医疗行业的人 字迹都很潦草\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know the medical profession is notorious for its illegibility,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.35,0:19:54.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是这个 用粗头钢笔写的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but this, written with a broad nibbed pen,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.95,0:19:56.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}墨水很差\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}very inferior ink.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.95,0:20:02.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}涂过柏油的麻绳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tarred twine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.20,0:20:04.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}斯德哥尔摩柏油\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stockholm tar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.50,0:20:06.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}结绳原封未动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Knots intact.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.92,0:20:21.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}粗盐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rough salt...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.13,0:20:23.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}埋在里面的是…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and embedded in it...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.76,0:20:27.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这些特殊的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These very singular enclosures.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.93,0:20:29.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你怎么看 华生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you think of it, Watson?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.60,0:20:32.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这个耳朵穿过耳洞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A ring has been torn from this ear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.77,0:20:36.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不是一对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They are not a pair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.73,0:20:40.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}贾科泰从解剖室 很容易挑两只\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I suppose it would be rather easier for Jacotett to have abstracted ears{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.03,0:20:44.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不成对的耳朵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from a dissecting room which were not actually a pair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.45,0:20:45.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To what purpose?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.95,0:20:49.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}某种恶作剧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some kind of disgusting practical joke.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.83,0:20:52.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这不是恶作剧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gentlemen, this is no practical joke.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.79,0:20:58.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当你进入解剖室里 首先察觉到的是什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What first strikes you when you enter a dissecting room?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.20,0:21:01.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}甲醛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Formaldehyde.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.20,0:21:03.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}该死 应该能问到甲醛味\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dammit, it should smell of formaldehyde.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.22,0:21:07.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是这个没有 这不是恶作剧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And it does not. This is no practical joke.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.22,0:21:10.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是严重的犯罪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a serious crime.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.89,0:21:16.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你妹妹 库欣小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your sister, Miss Cushing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.48,0:21:19.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}玛丽 终于来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mary. At last,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.93,0:21:24.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"玛丽 玛丽 十分叛逆"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mary, Mary, quite contrary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.29,0:21:31.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我以为是玛丽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought it was Mary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.08,0:21:36.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我来拿我的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've come to take some more of my things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.17,0:21:41.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们吵架之前我给你买了个礼物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I bought you a present before we argued.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.00,0:21:42.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你还是收下吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You may as well have it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.55,0:21:44.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不想要 我不想要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want it. I don't want it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.05,0:21:46.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the matter with you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.01,0:21:49.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}又是什么恶心的玩笑吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is it another disgusting prank?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.18,0:21:49.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.97,0:21:52.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}毕竟他是你的朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, he was your friend, after all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.14,0:21:52.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who was?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.89,0:21:55.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不想要你的恐怖包裹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want your horrid parcel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.18,0:21:58.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}拿去 保留一点礼仪吧 姐姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take it. Let's preserve the proprieties at least, sister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.36,0:22:01.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}礼仪？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Proprieties?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.19,0:22:06.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你敢谈礼仪？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You dare to talk about the proprieties?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.45,0:22:09.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你一生都在破坏社会规范\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have flouted the rules of society all your life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.66,0:22:13.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而你还敢厚颜无耻的指责我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you had the effrontery to accuse me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.37,0:22:15.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}阻止玛丽嫁给那个男人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of interfering with Mary's marrying that man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.87,0:22:16.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}难道不是？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Didn't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.75,0:22:19.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是你干了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But what did you do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.50,0:22:22.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我干了什么 我什么也没干\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did I do? I did nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.42,0:22:27.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你心知肚明 你给玛丽介绍了别的男人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what you did. You introduced Mary to other men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.30,0:22:31.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}带坏她 玛丽告诉了我她的无辜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Corrupting her. Mary has told me in her innocence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.30,0:22:32.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她责怪我？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She accused me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.68,0:22:35.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}玛丽从不责怪任何人 你知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mary accuses no one. You know that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.73,0:22:38.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但我知道你给她带来了不幸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I see your hand in her unhappiness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.52,0:22:40.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}胡说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nonsense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.52,0:22:45.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为什么吉姆 布劳纳又开始酗酒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why did Jim Browner start drinking again?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.28,0:22:50.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他对玛丽发过誓 因此他们在才一起的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He signed the pledge for Mary. That's what brought them together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.74,0:22:53.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她把蓝色丝带别在他胸前 他已经重新做人了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She pinned the blue ribbon to his chest and he was a new man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.54,0:22:57.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为什么他打破他的誓言？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So why did he break his pledge?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.58,0:22:58.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为什么问我？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why ask me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.42,0:23:01.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你为什么和他吵架\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why did you quarrel with him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.00,0:23:05.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我从来不赞成吉姆 布劳纳 这是事实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never approved of Jim Browner, that's true, but he deserved-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.46,0:23:09.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但他不应该因为你的多事 而重新酗酒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}better than being driven back to drink by your meddling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.42,0:23:42.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我回来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.96,0:23:43.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}吉姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jim.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.17,0:23:45.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你好 莎拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello Sarah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.05,0:23:48.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}玛丽没想到你会这么早回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mary wasn't expecting you till much later.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.21,0:23:51.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我赶上了尾潮 节约了一次潮汐的时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I managed to catch the tail end of the flood. Saved a whole tide.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.70,0:23:54.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她不在家？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She not here then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.01,0:23:58.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 库珀老奶奶又不舒服了 玛丽在陪她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. Old Mrs. Cooper's not well again. Mary's with her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.77,0:24:06.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我说我会来帮她洗衣服 她马上就回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I said I'd help her with the laundry. She'll be back soon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.95,0:24:14.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你帮了她很多 不是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You help her a lot, don't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.74,0:24:17.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}真好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's nice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.30,0:24:33.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我猜你知道我为什么帮她？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know why I help her I suppose?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.64,0:24:35.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.39,0:24:39.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为什么我老在这儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why I'm always round here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.18,0:24:41.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你是她姐姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're her sister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.86,0:24:51.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她不在身边五分钟 你都会不高兴 是吗 吉姆？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can't you be happy for five minutes without her, Jim?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.86,0:24:58.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}来 帮帮忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here, make yourself useful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.26,0:25:16.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}然后放下这一边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Drop the side then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.72,0:25:18.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.14,0:25:20.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你放下这个 然后拿起另一边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well you drop this and bring it up the other side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.81,0:25:22.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你什么意思 玛丽不这么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you mean? Mary doesn't do that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.77,0:25:25.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我敢说 玛丽不做的事情多着呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are plenty of things Mary doesn't do, I dare say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.48,0:25:33.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我来教你怎么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I'll show you how to do it, shall I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.57,0:25:37.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.57,0:25:42.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}过来 你拿着这个角\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, come on. You take this corner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.95,0:25:46.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好 现在 你放下这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right now, you drop this,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.59,0:25:55.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}然后你拿起这个 另一边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you bring it up the other side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.26,0:26:03.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你自己来 这不是我做的 我可不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You do it yourself. That's not for me. I want no part of that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.23,0:26:10.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}把女人的工作塞给我 你自己去做吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pushing women's work at me. You keep that to yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.37,0:26:30.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生和另一位先生来看你 夫人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Holmes and the other gentlemen to see you, madam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.09,0:26:33.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}让他们别把那些东西带进来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As long as they don't bring those things near me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.60,0:26:48.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他现在在哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And where is he now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.39,0:26:50.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}布劳纳和玛丽结婚时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Browner was on the South American line{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.06,0:26:55.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在跑南美航线 但他太爱她了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when he and Mary married. But he was so fond of her,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.69,0:26:58.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}于是他转到 北海航船上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that he found himself a berth in the North Sea boats.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.74,0:27:00.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}跑伦敦-登荷德航线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The London-Den Helder line.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.99,0:27:05.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}玛丽爱他吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And is Mary fond of him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.25,0:27:07.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们是恋爱结婚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was a love match.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.71,0:27:08.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}恋爱？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Love?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.91,0:27:10.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}尽管…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Although...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.46,0:27:12.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.50,0:27:16.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当时我不愿意承认这个事实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was loath to acknowledge it at the time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.80,0:27:19.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why was that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.76,0:27:22.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我觉得我的姐妹 不该嫁给一个船员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't think a sister of mine should be marrying a steward.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.89,0:27:26.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在呢 您现在感觉如何\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now? How do you feel now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.06,0:27:29.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想吉姆和玛丽本可以幸福\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think Jim and Mary could be happy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.35,0:27:32.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您的意思是他们并不幸福？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You mean they weren't?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.73,0:27:34.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一开始是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They were at first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.69,0:27:36.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}然后呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.74,0:27:40.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也许你该问问莎拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perhaps you should ask Sarah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.78,0:27:43.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她在那里住过一阵子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She practically lived there for a while.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.02,0:28:16.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在布劳纳先生在哪条船上？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which ship is Mr. Browner serving with at present?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.52,0:28:17.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"五朔节"号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The "May Morning".{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.23,0:28:22.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}17号启程 开往比利时和荷兰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She sailed on the seventeenth for Belgium and Holland.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.91,0:28:25.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}圣诞节他们在鹿特丹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They were in Rotterdam over Christmas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.83,0:28:29.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}船员抽签 吉姆今年运气不好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The crews draw lots and Jim was unlucky this year.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.29,0:28:33.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}玛丽得和我和莎拉一起过圣诞节\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mary was to have spent Christmas with Sarah and me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.79,0:28:37.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而现在莎拉 在旅店做看守人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now Sarah, of course, is now Warden at the mission.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.96,0:28:41.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您是否不让她和您住一起？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you sad not to have her living with you still?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.63,0:28:42.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.39,0:28:48.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}实话告诉你吧 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well to tell you the truth, Mr. Holmes,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.10,0:28:50.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们俩相处得不好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}things are not well between us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.77,0:28:55.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你们吵架了？为了什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have quarreled? What about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.56,0:28:58.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也许会和你妹妹 玛丽的失踪有关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It may have a bearing on what has happened to your sister, Mary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.86,0:29:03.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我知道 当然有关 你以为我不知道吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know that. Of course it does. Do you think I don't know that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.70,0:29:05.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我认为一切都是她的错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I blame her for everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.28,0:29:07.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}莎拉？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sarah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.41,0:29:10.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当然 莎拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course. Sarah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.20,0:29:15.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她老呆在玛丽家 完全没有这个必要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She spent far more time than was necessary at Mary's lodgings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.21,0:29:18.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}吉姆和玛丽才新婚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jim and Mary were just married,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.59,0:29:22.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}过着自己的新生活 结交新朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}making their own life, making their own friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.80,0:29:27.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而莎拉给他们介绍了亚历克 费尔贝恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then Sarah introduced Alec Fairbairn to them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.35,0:29:30.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我知道这不是好意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know it was not generously done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.77,0:29:35.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}看起来莎拉是想羞辱吉姆 布劳纳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sarah seemed to want to shame Jim Browner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.15,0:29:38.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不知道吉姆对莎拉做了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know what Jim had done to Sarah,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.98,0:29:43.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但好像她恨他 我相信…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but she seemed to hate him. I believe that...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.74,0:29:47.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你相信什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You believe what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.99,0:29:49.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}问她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ask her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.08,0:29:53.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}问莎拉 她在这里收拾她的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ask Sarah. She is here in the house collecting her things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.33,0:29:58.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}问她是不是想让玛丽和亚历克 费尔贝恩私奔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ask her if she did not mean Mary to go off with Alec Fairbairn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.04,0:30:00.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这就是她的目的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what she wanted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.00,0:30:03.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.01,0:30:13.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她已经收到消息了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah, the message has been received then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.50,0:30:37.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}咖啡？先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cafe, Monsieur.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.51,0:30:45.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢你的帮助 警督\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you for your help, Inspector.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.88,0:30:50.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这很难 福尔摩斯先生 我们不能忽视证据\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's very difficult, Mr. Holmes. We can't ignore the evidence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.51,0:30:53.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们知道了什么？包裹里的两只耳朵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What've we got? Two severed ears in a parcel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.60,0:30:54.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们知道一个医学院学生贾科泰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've got the medical student,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.97,0:30:57.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他被赶出了这位女士的家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jacotett who's been thrown out of the lady's house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.69,0:31:01.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}强烈的动机 包裹是19号从哈里奇寄出的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Strong motive. Parcel postmarked Harwich on the nineteenth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.77,0:31:05.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他19号也在哈里奇 只有这么多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was in Harwich on the nineteenth. That's as good as you get.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.82,0:31:08.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你的推理很浅显易懂 霍金斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your logic seems foolproof Hawkins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.15,0:31:09.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you. Well... Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.91,0:31:12.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}遗憾的是我不能阻止此事登报\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just regret that I haven't been able to keep it out of the newspapers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.95,0:31:15.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们正在为明早的头版写这个报道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're running the story in tomorrow morning's first editions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.74,0:31:18.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们也得到了苏珊 库欣小姐的名字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They've also managed to get hold of Miss Susan Cushing's name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.58,0:31:19.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她不会喜欢这样的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She won't like that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.58,0:31:20.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可怜的女人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. Poor woman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.50,0:31:24.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那么另一件案子 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This other matter then, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.13,0:31:26.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你也有想法了 是吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've clearly got some thoughts on that, haven't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.80,0:31:33.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我相信 某位华生医生的同行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's my belief, that a member of Dr. Watson's profession,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.43,0:31:36.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为了某种目的铤而走险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}possibly of some distinction, has overstepped the mark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.73,0:31:41.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}所有尸体都是拳击手的 业余或者其他的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The corpses all belong to pugilists, amateur or otherwise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.19,0:31:45.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}搏斗太久的拳击手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is the unfortunate characteristic{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.98,0:31:49.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有什么不幸的特征？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of boxers who have fought too long?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.57,0:31:53.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们的脑部会留下很多创伤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, there can be such scarring of the brain{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.82,0:31:56.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}会像喝醉了酒似的 说话含糊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that the men behave as if drunk, slurred speech,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.04,0:32:01.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}记忆缺失或者其他 他们变得头昏眼花\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}loss of memory and so on. They become punch drunk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.29,0:32:02.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}正是如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Precisely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.04,0:32:06.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您是说有人在研究 脑部组织病理学？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You mean somebody is studying the pathology of brain tissues?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.67,0:32:08.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我认为正是如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For all the best reasons, I dare say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.88,0:32:12.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们研究的热情 超过了他们的理性\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And their passion of the subject has outrun their judgment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.64,0:32:17.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}马库斯 兰宁爵士 我赌一个月的工资是马库斯爵士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir Marcus Lanyon, I'll wager a month's salary on Sir Marcus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.35,0:32:19.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这正是他的专业\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is precisely his specialty{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.48,0:32:21.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他没有耐心 冷血无情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and he is impatient to a fault, ruthlessly impatient.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.73,0:32:24.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在你知道了 警督\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There you have it, Inspector.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.93,0:32:58.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她很沮丧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She is very down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.43,0:33:01.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}下午她回来以后 就一直这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like this ever since she got back here this afternoon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.94,0:33:06.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}库欣小姐？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Miss Cushing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.02,0:33:12.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你和你的妹夫布劳纳先生 为何事争吵？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why did you quarrel with your brother-in-law, Mr. Browner?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.61,0:33:16.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}什么？你是谁 为何在此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? Who are you, what are you doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.57,0:33:17.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这位是歇洛克 福尔摩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Sherlock Holmes,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.78,0:33:21.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他正在调查你的妹妹 玛丽的失踪案\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he is investigating the disappearance of your sister, Mary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.21,0:33:27.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她和亚历克 费尔贝恩跑了 就是这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's gone off with Alec Fairbairn, that's all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.04,0:33:28.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.84,0:33:33.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她被她丈夫吓坏了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She had become frightened of her husband.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.55,0:33:34.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.80,0:33:39.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}吉姆 布劳纳是个酒鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jim Browner was a drunkard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.56,0:33:44.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他打她 为人卑劣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He offered her violence. He was beneath contempt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.94,0:33:47.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你对这对耳朵作何解释 库欣小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is your explanation for the severed ears, Miss Cushing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.40,0:33:52.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你见过那个硬纸盒子了 在你姐姐家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You saw the cardboard box. At your sister's house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.23,0:33:55.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那对耳朵是给你的 不是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those severed ears were meant for you were they not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.82,0:34:01.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这个信息是给你的 你知道它们意味着什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The message was for you. You understood what they meant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.91,0:34:04.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是马塞尔 贾科泰寄来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marcel Jacotett sent them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.58,0:34:08.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他告诉我他会做些什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He told me he might do something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.75,0:34:12.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我没想到他会做这么恶心的事儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't realize he would do anything so disgusting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.51,0:34:23.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她在说谎 华生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She is lying, Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.89,0:34:26.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她在空口说白话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's lying through her teeth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.59,0:34:57.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}格尔在外面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gull is outside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.88,0:34:58.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}太棒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}ExceHenL{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.80,0:35:00.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我去过航线办公室了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been to the shipping line offices too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.76,0:35:01.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}然后？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.51,0:35:03.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}正如你所认为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's as you thought. The "May Morning"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.43,0:35:06.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"五朔节"号于17号从伦敦出发驶往登荷德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}set sail from London for Den Helder on the seventeenth,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.81,0:35:09.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是一个大桶松开了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but a hogshead got loose in her hold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.69,0:35:12.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}使一个横梁脱了节 必须进港维修\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She sprang a plate and had to put in for repairs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.52,0:35:13.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在哈里奇？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To Harwich?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.86,0:35:17.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在哈里奇 船员18号放假\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To Harwich. The crew were given leave on the eighteenth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.15,0:35:19.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"五朔月"号在19号晚启程\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The "May Morning" left late on the nineteenth,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.99,0:35:22.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就是包裹寄出的同一天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the day the parcel was posted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.78,0:35:25.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}太棒了 华生 有答案了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excellent Watson. We have it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.51,0:35:38.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.84,0:35:41.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}格尔先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Gull.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.47,0:35:45.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们来了电报 吉姆 布劳纳今晚7点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They have telegraphed. Jim Browner came off the ferry at Ramsgate at{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.10,0:35:47.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在拉姆斯盖特下船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}seven o'clock this evening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.43,0:35:50.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很好 我就知道我可以信任您\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good. I knew I could rely on you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.60,0:35:54.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我可以信任您吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I can rely on you, can I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.52,0:35:55.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.36,0:36:00.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}马库斯 兰宁爵士这个名字 对你有什么意义吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does the name Sir Marcus Lanyon mean anything to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.20,0:36:02.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可能有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It might.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.82,0:36:04.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他会得到警告\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He will be warned off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.54,0:36:09.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您从中获利的工作将结束\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The orders from which you have been profiting will dry up{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.25,0:36:12.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}同样警察对您的兴趣也会随之消失\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but so will the police interest in you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.50,0:36:15.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我很满意这个结果\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll be satisfied with that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.30,0:36:21.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们谈了笔好买卖 格尔先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've acquired a bargain, Mr. Gull.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.02,0:36:34.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.98,0:36:36.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.32,0:36:39.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}包裹上的绳结 是单套结和接绳结\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The knots used on the parcel were a bowline and a sheet bend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.32,0:36:41.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 水手结\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sailor's knots.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.24,0:36:45.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你知道水手们一般不会磨刀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know that sailors deliberately do not sharpen their knives?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.53,0:36:48.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 除非有事故\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah, in case of accidents.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.41,0:36:50.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因此这个残忍的切割\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hence the crude amputations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.41,0:36:57.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哈里奇是关键 而布劳纳当时在那儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Harwich was the key and Browner was there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.21,0:36:59.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在我推测\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, I suppose...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.17,0:37:04.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}布劳纳意外回到家中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Browner, returned unexpectedly,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.66,0:37:08.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}发现他妻子和费尔贝恩在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}found his wife with Fairbairn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.43,0:37:14.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他尾随他们 杀害了他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He followed them. He murdered them both.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.10,0:37:17.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}各切下他们一人的耳朵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He severed an ear from each{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.73,0:37:20.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}然后寄给莎拉 库欣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and sent them as he thought to Sarah Cushing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.40,0:37:26.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当然他会立刻到那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course, he will go there immediately.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.28,0:37:28.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他等不及要告诉她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He will be desperate{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.29,0:37:35.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那两只耳朵是给她的 而非给她姐姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for her to know that the severed ears were for her, not for her sister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.46,0:37:37.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就是这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, that being the case...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.38,0:37:42.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在周日也有火车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The railway is operating as if it were a Sunday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.38,0:37:45.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.26,0:37:47.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因为还是圣诞期间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because the Christmas holiday is still on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.43,0:37:51.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你有没有意识到布劳纳 可能搭更早的火车？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you realize, Browner could have caught a much earlier train.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.14,0:37:55.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 我没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I did not know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.05,0:38:25.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}玛丽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.52,0:38:41.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是什么 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is this, Mr. Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.69,0:38:44.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一次你的特殊经历 警督\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A unique experience for you, Inspector.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.53,0:38:47.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你或许能在知道一桩谋杀发生之前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You may apprehend a murderer{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.36,0:38:50.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就抓到一个凶杀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}before you have even acknowledged there has been a murder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.11,0:39:30.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 你惊讶吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aye. Well you may stare.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.62,0:39:36.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}看着我 莎拉 库欣 这是你的拿手好戏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at me Sarah Cushing, this is your handiwork.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.37,0:39:39.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你做了什么 吉姆？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What have you done, Jim?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.41,0:39:40.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我做了什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What have I done?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.38,0:39:44.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是你做了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nay, it's what you've done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.63,0:39:50.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我求求你 好好看着我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I beg you, Jim. Look on me kindly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.01,0:39:55.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我做的一切 都是为了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever I did, I did for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.77,0:39:59.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.86,0:40:05.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是你毒害了她的思想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You poisoned her mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.57,0:40:08.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我这么做是为了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I did it for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.74,0:40:14.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们抓住了那个房客 我告诉他们是他做的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They have arrested the lodger. I told them he did it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.41,0:40:19.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们丝毫没有怀疑你 吉姆 你可以逃脱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They suspect nothing of you, Jim. You can get away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.12,0:40:24.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}逃脱？你以为我能逃脱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get away? You think I can get away?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.42,0:40:29.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当一切没发生过 你这么以为 不是吗 你疯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put it all behind me, do you think? Do you? Well, you're mad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.22,0:40:33.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是我 就在这儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is me. It's in here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.87,0:40:36.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}每一幕每一幕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every last moment of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.31,0:40:39.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}每天都在我面前 不断重现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Comes out of the daylight at me. Goes on and on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.98,0:40:42.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}自打犯案起 我不敢闭着眼睛睡觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I tell you, I dare not shut an eye and sleep since I did it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.35,0:40:45.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不敢一个人呆着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm never without one or the other before me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.11,0:40:49.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}愿你的血在你的血管里腐败\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May the blood rot in your veins, Sarah Cushing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.69,0:40:52.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.24,0:40:57.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我爱你 我爱你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love you. I love you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.24,0:41:00.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我爱你 我爱你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love you. I love you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.00,0:41:04.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我相信 我告诉你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I believe you do. I tell you something,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.21,0:41:10.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我宁愿从被我杀死的她口中听到一个字 也不要你的爱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd rather have one kind word from her I've killed than all your love.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.84,0:41:13.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我宁愿看着她多呼吸一分钟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd rather see her breathing one minute{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.18,0:41:15.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也不要你给我一辈子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}more than a lifetime that you could give me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.64,0:41:19.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}别这么说 别这么说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't say that. Don't say that. Don't say that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.03,0:41:31.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她爱我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She loved me,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.95,0:41:35.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这就是一切的根源\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that the rule of the business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.37,0:41:39.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是她知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But she knew,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.87,0:41:43.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她知道 她知道我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}she knew, she knew I,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.25,0:41:47.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想到我泥地里的脚印\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought more of my wife's footprint in the mud{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.67,0:41:50.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}多于想到她的身体和灵魂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}than I did of her, body and soul.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.92,0:41:55.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}做梦也没想到啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoever would have dreamt it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.39,0:42:05.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而且\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.69,0:42:11.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在拒绝了莎拉的殷勤之后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}after you'd rejected Sarah's advances?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.69,0:42:16.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我一个字也没对玛丽说 我想这会让她难过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never said a word to Mary for I thought it would grieve her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.57,0:42:20.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}然后我发现玛丽开始变了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then I began to see a change in Mary herself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.24,0:42:25.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我妻子一向 善解人意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My wife had always been so understanding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.04,0:42:29.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在她对一切都怀疑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now she was suspicious of everything I did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.25,0:42:36.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们开始无谓的争吵 完全没有原因\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We began to row about nothing, nothing at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.26,0:42:39.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这让我发狂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And it maddened me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.30,0:42:42.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}事实也是如此吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And this was said as well?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.85,0:42:46.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 不是我瞎想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aye, I didn't see it then mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.60,0:42:53.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我只是看到一切都不对了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just saw it all go wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.86,0:42:57.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她和玛丽形影不离\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She and Mary were inseparable and then,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.28,0:43:01.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}后来我开了戒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}well then I broke my blue ribbon{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.76,0:43:05.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}又开始酗酒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and began drinking again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.83,0:43:09.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}所以玛丽有理由讨厌我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So Mary had some reason to be disgusted with me now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.00,0:43:16.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}然后这个费尔贝恩就插进来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then this Fairbairn fellow chipped in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.97,0:43:21.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他是个时髦浮华的小伙子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was a dashing, swaggering sort of a chap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.14,0:43:26.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}聪明 长着一头卷发 还受过教育 我认为他很健谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Smart and curled, educated too, I reckon he could talk, he could.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.27,0:43:29.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是一件小事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blind I was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.81,0:43:35.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}使我产生了疑虑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was a little thing put me on to him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.36,0:43:41.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我那天偶尔来到客厅 一进门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I came into the parlor unexpected one day and as I came in{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.95,0:43:45.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我看见我妻子眼睛里闪过欢迎的光\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I saw the light of welcome in my wife's eyes, but{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.33,0:43:49.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但当她发现是我时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when she saw it was me,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.47,0:43:53.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她带着失望的表情转身就走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}she turned away with a look of disappointment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.30,0:43:59.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}肯定是把我当成亚历克 费尔贝恩了 不会是别人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There was no one but Alec Fairbairn whose steps she could mistake for mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.38,0:44:02.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}从那一刻起我的平静就一去不复返了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I tell you, from that moment on my peace was gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.85,0:44:08.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}莎拉当时在厨房 我直接走进厨房 告诉她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sarah was in the kitchen and I went straight through and I told her that{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.93,0:44:14.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果费尔贝恩再出现在我家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"if Fairbairn ever set foot in my place again"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.52,0:44:19.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我就把他的耳朵留给你做纪念\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"I'd send her his ears for a keepsake".{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.07,0:44:28.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我希望你是在法国犯下这个案子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I believe I could wish you had committed this deed of yours in France.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.96,0:44:33.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们承认冲动犯罪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They acknowledge the crime of passion there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.55,0:44:42.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你不会让他们把我单独留在这 是吗 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You won't let them leave me alone, will you sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.01,0:44:44.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.93,0:44:47.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I won't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.23,0:44:53.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我走的时候会叫个警官进来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I leave I'll send an officer in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.90,0:44:57.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不想一个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't like to be alone, see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.51,0:46:50.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}到你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your turn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.31,0:46:59.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我去去就来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Won't be a minute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.21,0:47:24.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她让事情变糟的 是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She made it go wrong, didn't she?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.22,0:47:30.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你心里从来都只有我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you never thought of anyone but me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.22,0:47:33.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是吗 吉姆？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you, Jim?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.60,0:47:39.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她爱你 她让我恨你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She loved you and she made me hate you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.78,0:47:53.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}看起来似乎她有什么秘密\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There. It was if you had a secret, you see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.58,0:47:57.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她让我往最坏处想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She made me think the worst.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.41,0:48:01.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这个秘密就是她爱我？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The secret was her love with me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.54,0:48:06.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你该让她远离我们的生活 吉姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should have got rid of her from our lives, Jim.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.55,0:48:13.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我知道 我知道那会伤害你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know. But I thought it would hurt you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.02,0:48:18.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}看看我们现在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at us now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.56,0:48:24.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我真傻 真是瞎了眼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was stupid. Blind as a pickle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.52,0:51:14.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是什么意思 华生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is the meaning of it, Watson?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.11,0:51:18.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这一连串的痛苦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is the object of{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.42,0:51:23.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}暴力和恐惧究竟是为了什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}this circle of misery and violence and fear?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.99,0:51:26.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一定有某种目的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It must have a purpose{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.12,0:51:30.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不然我们这个宇宙就毫无意义\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or our universe had no meaning{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.21,0:51:33.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而这是无法想象的 但是是什么目的呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and that is unthinkable, but what purpose?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.59,0:51:42.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是人类的大问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is humanity's great problem{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.14,0:51:47.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}思索了多少年 也没有答案\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for which reason so far has no answer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.00,0:52:00.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
